# Never put tokens in GitHub code or frontend JS.
# BOT_TOKEN: Cloudflare Worker secret, from BotFather (do not paste here).
# TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET: NEW Cloudflare Worker secret, copy securely to local environment for setWebhook.
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN + CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID: GitHub Actions production secrets.
# TGCLOUD_TOKEN is NOT USED for the native Game release.
# ELEMENTAL_API_BASE: non-secret HTTPS Worker origin, GitHub Actions variable or config.js.
